                                "sense_id": "d9df8ffd-9f37-380c-9c2a-3299ab1f40a0",
                                "text": "Shady looking thicknecks accompany the businessmen and other types. These gentlemen, who require no assistance whatsoever to disembowel any potential troublemaker, are the right-hand men of the modern-day Russian bosses."
